{"n":99,"ar":"الزلزلة","name":"Az-Zalzalah","mean":"The Earthquake","type":"medinan","v":[{"a":["إِذَا","زُلۡزِلَتِ","ٱلۡأَرۡضُ","زِلۡزَالَهَا"],"w":["When","is shaken","the earth","(with) its earthquake"],"t":["idhā","zul'zilati","l-arḍu","zil'zālahā"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"When the earth is shaken with its [final] earthquake"},{"a":["وَأَخۡرَجَتِ","ٱلۡأَرۡضُ","أَثۡقَالَهَا"],"w":["And brings forth","the earth","its burdens"],"t":["wa-akhrajati","l-arḍu","athqālahā"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"And the earth discharges its burdens"},{"a":["وَقَالَ","ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ","مَا","لَهَا"],"w":["And says","man","What","(is) with it"],"t":["waqāla","l-insānu","mā","lahā"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"And man says, \"What is [wrong] with it"},{"a":["يَوۡمَئِذࣲ","تُحَدِّثُ","أَخۡبَارَهَا"],"w":["That Day","it will report","its news"],"t":["yawma-idhin","tuḥaddithu","akhbārahā"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"That Day, it will report its news"},{"a":["بِأَنَّ","رَبَّكَ","أَوۡحَىٰ","لَهَا"],"w":["Because","your Lord","inspired","[to] it"],"t":["bi-anna","rabbaka","awḥā","lahā"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"Because your Lord has commanded it"},{"a":["يَوۡمَئِذࣲ","يَصۡدُرُ","ٱلنَّاسُ","أَشۡتَاتࣰا","لِّيُرَوۡاْ","أَعۡمَٰلَهُمۡ"],"w":["That Day","will proceed","the mankind","(in) scattered groups","to be shown","their deeds"],"t":["yawma-idhin","yaṣduru","l-nāsu","ashtātan","liyuraw","aʿmālahum"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"en":"That Day, the people will depart separated [into categories] to be shown [the result of] their deeds"},{"a":["فَمَن","يَعۡمَلۡ","مِثۡقَالَ","ذَرَّةٍ","خَيۡرࣰا","يَرَهُۥ"],"w":["So whoever","does","(equal to the) weight","(of) an atom","good","will see it"],"t":["faman","yaʿmal","mith'qāla","dharratin","khayran","yarahu"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"en":"So whoever does an atom's weight of good will see it"},{"a":["وَمَن","يَعۡمَلۡ","مِثۡقَالَ","ذَرَّةࣲ","شَرࣰّا","يَرَهُۥ"],"w":["And whoever","does","(equal to the) weight","(of) an atom","evil","will see it"],"t":["waman","yaʿmal","mith'qāla","dharratin","sharran","yarahu"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"en":"And whoever does an atom's weight of evil will see it"}]}